                            "point of view (“觀點”) 之首字母縮略詞",
                            "某人的認知、情感； 從該觀點來看",
                            "一種話語標記，用以暗示「不妨試著想像自己身處這段文字、照片、影片所描繪的情境中」，即使在存在第三人稱視角的情況下亦然；可參照fourth wall joke。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "attributive",
                            "broadly",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a99092ba-d9f2-4b74-b0c9-11108e5d1ca7",
                                "sense_id": "6d6bcf51-c77b-310c-9771-0af78923244b",
                                "text": "By this time we might suspect that he had not been looking at her in the previous shot, and that the bird shot had been from his pov."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "60bb4225-d2c0-4cde-93dc-7d205da5356e",
                                "sense_id": "6d6bcf51-c77b-310c-9771-0af78923244b",
                                "text": "From his pov, we see Boom Boom Grossman, 60, huge ex-pug Jack Dempsey look-alike with meat-hook hands and meat-pie face."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fabe29ae-f16e-40f3-be50-49c87aff8b35",
                                "sense_id": "6d6bcf51-c77b-310c-9771-0af78923244b",
                                "text": "When one of the girls goes down into the basement, she is devoured by the POV accompanied by audio portions of werewolfish sounds."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0de5446-242f-447c-8155-0b0a087143be",
                                "sense_id": "6d6bcf51-c77b-310c-9771-0af78923244b",
                                "text": "A female point-of-view (pov) character is not necessarily written from the perspective of a female gaze. […] A pov character is a character through whose eyes and perspective we follow the action of the story."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68d5d63a-4985-4b07-9813-274e11f14d02",
                                "sense_id": "6d6bcf51-c77b-310c-9771-0af78923244b",
                                "text": "The film takes us immediately to Oscar’s pov, complete with momentary ‘blackouts’ as he blinks. […] Soon, still from Oscar’s pov, he begins lighting up a form of hallucinatory drug, and after a seemingly interminable number of attempts, begins to achieve the high he was seeking."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c570a1e3-41a9-47a2-adf2-5421440b3ef3",
                                "sense_id": "6d6bcf51-c77b-310c-9771-0af78923244b",
                                "text": "Who would dare theorize the history and practice of jazz without taking into account its significant composers, vocalists and instrumentalists from their pov?",
                                "translation": "谁敢在不考虑爵士乐的重要作曲家、歌手和乐器演奏家的视角的情况下，就对爵士乐的历史和实践进行理论探讨呢？"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "432c2d1b-66e1-4657-8c72-6a0835626e2b",
                                "sense_id": "6d6bcf51-c77b-310c-9771-0af78923244b",
                                "text": "I type ‘high cortisol’ into the search bar and keep scrolling. ‘You’re not ugly, you just have cortisol face,’ declares one video. ‘POV you finally drop the cortisol belly,’ reads another. A third screams in caps lock, ‘HOW TO LOWER CORTISOL’. I’m sold. Cortisol is to blame for everything. But how do I fix it?",
                                "translation": "我在搜索栏输入“高皮质醇”，然后继续往下翻。“你并不丑，你只是皮质醇脸而已。”一个视频这样说道。“想象一下：你终于减掉了皮质醇肚。”另一个视频写道。第三个视频用大写字母喊道：“如何降低皮质醇？”我被说动了。皮质醇是所有问题的罪魁祸首。但我该如何解决这个问题呢？"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d516d46a-8575-3e4f-bf15-7d569ad04d2f",
                        "entry_id": "3219c791-5e17-3d20-8a7f-0a36a223ff27",
                        "glosses": [
                            "point of view (“觀點”) 之首字母縮略詞",
                            "某人的視角； 從該視角來看"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "attributive",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d96b9fd9-2a80-4445-bc32-60d8a644740d",
                                "sense_id": "d516d46a-8575-3e4f-bf15-7d569ad04d2f",
                                "text": "POV videos",
                                "translation": "第一视角视频"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40e9160d-48b6-4eea-9db5-fe2c768c2a0f",
                                "sense_id": "d516d46a-8575-3e4f-bf15-7d569ad04d2f",
                                "text": "Ms. Brier specializes in point of view, or P.O.V., videos that confront relatable, often hateable characters, with a subtle sneer, gleefully rubbery body and arch delivery of generational catchphrases like “slay, queen” and “I got you,” often repeated for effect.",
                                "translation": "布里尔女士擅长制作第一人称视角视频，她以微妙的嘲讽、欢快的橡胶般的身体和夸张的语气演绎“女王驾到”和“我罩着你”等一代人的流行语，这些流行语经常重复以达到效果，从而引发人们的共鸣，但这些视频中的人物往往令人讨厌。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c4b214c-b60f-4fff-b11c-142c88a68020",
                                "sense_id": "d516d46a-8575-3e4f-bf15-7d569ad04d2f",
                                "text": "The earliest discovered dwerking video was shared by a TikToker named @mojothewzzrd back in May. Like many dwerking videos, this original video has an unserious tone, given away by its POV caption.",
                                "translation": "最早被发现的“dwerking”视频是由一位名叫@mojothewzzrd的TikTok用户在五月份分享的。和许多“dwerking”视频一样，这段原始视频的基调轻松诙谐，从其第一人称视角的字幕就能看出。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
